{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22344","headline":"思归 · 白居易","name":"思归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"养无晨昏膳，隐无伏腊资。\n遂求及亲禄，僶俛来京师。\n薄俸未及亲，别家已经时。\n冬积温席恋，春违采兰期。\n夏至一阴生，稍稍夕漏迟。\n块然抱愁者，长夜独先知。\n悠悠乡关路，梦去身不随。\n坐惜时节变，蝉鸣槐花枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}